tres (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Repair session ownership checks and clean manual uninstallation.
  * Preserve separate scaling settings for multiple Wayland outputs.
  * Add Tres-scoped GTK and wlroots portal integration.
  * Supervise the three-square panel and allow explicit panel restart.
  * Display only configured shortcuts; offer opt-in suggested bindings.
  * Require approval before falling back from a selected file manager.
  * Support wpctl and pactl audio controls with actionable errors.
  * Add real headless Labwc/GTK3 integration testing.
  * Remove duplicate Debian packaging entries and dependencies.

